(7729082, 1272589, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is so fun!! I wish I had one for my cat! Welcome back and congrats on the HM!!<br/> <br/>Hmmm... Ok -- the more that I think about it, it would be a great idea. Did you install these yourself? Where did you find it?</td>', 'This is so fun!! I wish I had one for my cat! Welcome back and congrats on the HM!! Hmmm... Ok -- the more that I think about it, it would be a great idea. Did you install these yourself? Where did you find it?', '2022-09-02 10:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7729083, 1272589, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> This is so fun!! I wish I had one for my cat! Welcome back and congrats on the HM!!<br/> <br/>Hmmm... Ok -- the more that I think about it, it would be a great idea. Did you install these yourself? Where did you find it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey thanks.  We got them on Amazon and yes quick install.  Just pop the hinge pins and cut a simple circle (template included) with a jigsaw.  The two pieces attach with sticky pads on either side of the hole.  Rehang the door and voila!   <br/> <br/>Took about 10 minutes. <br/> <br/>The Kitty Pass Interior Cat Door... <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017KXN7DG?ref=ppx_pop_mob_ap_share" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017KXN7DG?ref=ppx_pop_mob_ap_share</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-09-02 09:34:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: This is so fun!! I wish I had one for my cat! Welcome back and congrats on the HM!! Hmmm... Ok -- the more that I think about it, it would be a great idea. Did you install these yourself? Where did you find it?   Hey thanks.  We got them on Amazon and yes quick install.  Just pop the hinge pins and cut a simple circle (template included) with a jigsaw.  The two pieces attach with sticky pads on either side of the hole.  Rehang the door and voila!    Took about 10 minutes.  The Kitty Pass Interior Cat Door... https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017KXN7DG?ref=ppx_pop_mob_ap_share', '2022-09-02 10:34:47.000000', '2022-09-02 10:34:59.000000', 0),
