(7729114, 1272471, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> This was my favorite of the challenge. The cat was a nice bonus. </i></td></tr></table>do you think there''s a cat in this photo? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Youre on the money as ever. Its a painted cat too.<br/> <br/>Ive been think of you and this photo during the challenge - I remember a comment you made before on me taking someone elses message. Ive certainly done that here. Other than pointing and shooting, Ive added nothing - save for choosing whether I had passers by in or not.<br/> <br/>I wanted to showcase a political commentary nonetheless so happy that it has found a wider audience, but I certainly dont deserve any credit at all.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by markwiley: This was my favorite of the challenge. The cat was a nice bonus. do you think there''s a cat in this photo?   Youre on the money as ever. Its a painted cat too. Ive been think of you and this photo during the challenge - I remember a comment you made before on me taking someone elses message. Ive certainly done that here. Other than pointing and shooting, Ive added nothing - save for choosing whether I had passers by in or not. I wanted to showcase a political commentary nonetheless so happy that it has found a wider audience, but I certainly dont deserve any credit at all.', '2022-09-02 18:51:20.000000', NULL, 0),
